{
  "title": "Card Effect Previews",
  "description": "Reaction windows now state what playing the card would do right now (which card it cancels, which ship it destroys, how many hits it cancels, ...), drawn from engine-provided facts, and a strip under the top bar lists the lingering card effects in force with their seat and expiry. Each card is shown before (base commit, same mocked decision) and after, on desktop and a 390x844 phone. Fixtures are synthetic but shaped exactly like the engine's DecisionContext.previews and GameView.active_effects.",
  "tag": "web/e2e/screenshots/EB-reaction-effects",
  "intro": "\n    <h2>Coverage</h2>\n    <p>39 cards now say what playing them would do (the 26 reaction-only cards and the 11 marker cards of the audit, plus Scramble Frequency and Veto). 20 cards leave a lingering effect that the active-effects strip shows while it is in force.</p>\n    <table><thead><tr><th>Card</th><th>Audit class</th><th>Reaction window</th><th>Active-effects strip</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sabotage</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Coup d'Etat</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Shields Holding</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Maneuvering Jets</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Direct Hit</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Reflective Shielding</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Emergency Repairs</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Morale Boost</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Fighter Prototype</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Flank Speed</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Lost Star Chart</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Nav Suite</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Solar Flare</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Rout</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Intercept</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Waylay</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Scramble Frequency</td><td>extra</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Salvage</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Bunker</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Blitz</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Disable</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Parley</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Infiltrate</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Counterstroke</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Rally</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Harness Energy</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>War Machine</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Deadly Plot</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Confounding Legal Text</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Hack Election</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Veto</td><td>extra</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Distinguished Councilor</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Political Stability</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Reverse Engineer</td><td>reaction-only</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Master Plan</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Puppets on a String</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Extreme Duress</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr><tr><td>Crisis</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"no\">one-shot: gone before the next question</td></tr><tr><td>Black Market Dealings</td><td>marker card</td><td class=\"ok\">preview</td><td class=\"ok\">strip</td></tr></tbody></table>\n    <h2>Not covered</h2>\n    <p>These reaction cards have no preview because playing them asks their own question (a pick, a rider outcome, a retreat, a dice reroll), which their own pickers handle: Ancient Burial Sites, Assassinate Representative, Bribery, Confusing Legal Text, Construction Rider, Courageous to the End, Crash Landing, Decoy Operation, Diplomacy Rider, Diplomatic Pressure, Experimental Battlestation, Fire Team, Forward Supply Base, Ghost Squad, Imperial Rider, In the Silence of Space, Insider Information, Leadership Rider, Lie in Wait, Manipulate Investments, Politics Rider, Public Disgrace, Reparations, Rescue, Reveal Prototype, Sanction, Skilled Retreat, Summit, Technology Rider, Trade Rider, Upgrade, Warfare Rider.</p>\n    <p>Master Plan, Puppets on a String, Crisis, Coup d'Etat, Deadly Plot, Veto and Confounding Legal Text are one-shot: the engine consumes their flag before the next question is asked, so there is no lingering state to show; their preview in the window is the whole indication.</p>",
